      "text": [
        "ه عن سماعة بن مهران فقد رويته عن أبي- رضي اللّه عنه- عن عليّ ابن إبراهيم بن هاشم، عن أبيه، عن عثمان بن عيسى العامريّ، عن سماعة بن مهران‌."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Everything in this book that is narrated from Sama'ah ibn Mihran has been transmitted by me from my father - may Allah (swt) be pleased with him - from Ali ibn Ibrahim ibn Hashim, from his father, from Uthman ibn Isa Al-Amiri, from Sama'ah ibn Mihran."
        ]
      }
